  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "room-seventeen.bond.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それだけの、常連だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "本日もお越しくださって……いえ。違いますね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "身内には、こう言うのでした。——おかえりなさい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "使い方、合ってるか怪しい。でも、悪い気はしなかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ただ、今日は困りごとが一つ。他のチームメンバーも噂を聞いて、休憩に来たがってる。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "部屋の返事は、悩んだ末の増築ラッシュだった。轟音とともに、階が生える生える。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "仮眠階。読書階。誰かのための温度低めの階。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "天井の高い階。もてなしの癖は、身内相手でも豪快に出る。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "十七号室さん、増築ストップ!　みんな、豪華な階が目当てじゃないんです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "あなたの部屋は、雨の日にほっとするから人気なんですよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……ほっと、する。……その機能は、どの階に、実装されているのでしょう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "階じゃないです。あなたです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "雨の音をちょっと大きくしてくれたり、お茶が冷めた頃に新しいのが出てきたり。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "そういうの、全部あなたでしょう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "部屋が、照れた。照れると、照明が全部いっせいに三割暗くなるらしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "百二十階ぶんの照れは、停電と区別がつかない。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「そういえば、この部屋の鍵って、ないんですか。私、合鍵とか持ってた方が……」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "返事は、少し間をおいて、静かに来た。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "あなたの鍵は、作りません。……鍵で開く扉は、音がしないので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "私は、あなたのノックが、聞きたいのです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.zzyjm6",
      "speakerName": "十七号室",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "あの、二回のあとに少し間があって、もう一回のノックが。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "自分のノックの癖を、私は今日まで知らなかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "部屋は、知っていた。常連の音を覚える建築だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.011c",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.011c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "雨の音の中で、耳が熱くなる。心拍まで、ちょっと速い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.011d",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.011d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この部屋、心拍も聞こえてるんだろうか。聞こえてませんように。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "room-seventeen.bond.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "休憩の残り時間で、チーム用の整備をひとつ決める。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "room-seventeen.bond.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "room-seventeen.bond.choice.001",
          "label": "迷わず戻れる部屋を、一緒に一つ決める",
          "result": "チーム全員で相談して「帰り部屋」を一つ決めた。誰が迷っても、扉を三つ開ければ必ず出る小部屋。壁には全員ぶんのマグ掛けが生えた。迷路の真ん中に、迷わない場所が一つ。避難訓練は、なぜかピクニックみたいに。",
          "intent": "迷宮の中に、全員の帰る場所を作る",
          "promise": "読みにくい成長になる代わりに、この人だけの成長を大きく進める。",
          "memory": "帰り部屋のマグ掛けの位置を、全員が自分で決めた。",
          "tone": "wild",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
